      "wowApiArg": null,
      "notes": "Adreno 840 (Snapdragon 8 Elite Gen 5, OnePlus 15): the pinned Turnip shows corruption here (issue #13) because it only knows A840 as 0xffff44050A31 while retail phones report 0x44050A21; Gen 8 Turnip knows both. Not yet run on an Adreno 840 phone."
